OL,5,G2206 The Climate Question
OL,6,     FThe El Nino weather pattern has
OL,7,     Fstarted and could be one of the
OL,8,     Fstrongest on record. So how does
OL,9,     FEl Nino work exactly? And what's
OL,10,     Fthe link with climate change?
