OL,14,G2232 Assignment
OL,15,     FIn Germany the system makes it
OL,16,     Fhard for disabled people to find
OL,17,     Fwork. Often they find jobs in
OL,18,     Finstitutions that pay less than
OL,19,     Fminimum wage. So how could Germany
OL,20,     Fbe more inclusive?
